From 549e22ca05bf2d5d27aa071b9f9145fe3785b58c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 7 Jul 2026 04:29:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: regenerate composer.lock for PHP 8.3 compatibility

The lock file had drifted to Symfony 8.x packages requiring PHP >=8.4,
breaking the Docker build which uses php:8.3-fpm. Pin the platform to
8.3 and regenerate the lock so resolved versions match the runtime.
